Package: com.snowgears.shop.test.util. Test utility docstrings.

[_summary]
Utility tests for the Shop plugin. Tests MariaDB JDBC client version fix, MiniMessage formatting regression, and gradient word preservation.

[_conclusions]
Utility tests cover dependency fixes, message formatting, and regression prevention.

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
MariaDB Java client 2.7.14 resolves cleartext password disclosure vulnerability to MITM on initial handshake.

[_does]
Tests MariaDB JDBC client version fix (Issue #204), MiniMessage formatting regression (Issue #152/shopbugs#496), and gradient word preservation in formatting.

